          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Both population standard deviations are known, so use the two-sample $z$ statistic: $$z_0=\\frac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\dfrac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}}=\\frac{33.7-35.6}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3.7^2}{32}+\\dfrac{3.5^2}{36}}}=\\frac{-1.9}{\\sqrt{0.42781+0.34028}}=\\frac{-1.9}{0.87641}=-2.168\\approx-2.17.$$ The sign is negative because Population 1 (PlayStation) has the smaller mean.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Đã biết cả hai độ lệch chuẩn tổng thể nên dùng thống kê $z$ hai mẫu: $$z_0=\\frac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\sigma_1^2}{n_1}+\\dfrac{\\sigma_2^2}{n_2}}}=\\frac{33{,}7-35{,}6}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3{,}7^2}{32}+\\dfrac{3{,}5^2}{36}}}=\\frac{-1{,}9}{0{,}87641}=-2{,}168\\approx-2{,}17.$$ Dấu âm vì Tổng thể 1 (PlayStation) có trung bình nhỏ hơn.</p></div>"
