          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Equal variances ⇒ pooled two-sample $t$. Pooled variance: $$s_p^2=\\frac{(n_1-1)s_1^2+(n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2}=\\frac{24(2.25)+29(3.61)}{53}=\\frac{54+104.69}{53}=2.9942,\\quad s_p=1.7304.$$ Then $$t_0=\\frac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{s_p\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}}}=\\frac{20-18}{1.7304\\sqrt{0.04+0.03333}}=\\frac{2}{1.7304(0.27080)}=\\frac{2}{0.46859}=4.268\\approx4.27.$$ Positive, since sample 1 has the larger mean.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Cùng phương sai ⇒ dùng $t$ hai mẫu gộp. Phương sai gộp: $$s_p^2=\\frac{24(2{,}25)+29(3{,}61)}{53}=\\frac{158{,}69}{53}=2{,}9942,\\quad s_p=1{,}7304.$$ Khi đó $$t_0=\\frac{\\bar x_1-\\bar x_2}{s_p\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{25}+\\frac{1}{30}}}=\\frac{2}{1{,}7304(0{,}27080)}=\\frac{2}{0{,}46859}=4{,}268\\approx4{,}27.$$ Dấu dương vì mẫu 1 có trung bình lớn hơn.</p></div>"
