          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Sample proportions: $\\hat p_1=\\dfrac{540}{600}=0.90$, $\\hat p_2=\\dfrac{340}{400}=0.85$. Under $H_0:p_1=p_2$ we pool: $\\hat p=\\dfrac{540+340}{600+400}=\\dfrac{880}{1000}=0.88$. Then $$z_0=\\frac{\\hat p_1-\\hat p_2}{\\sqrt{\\hat p(1-\\hat p)\\left(\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}\\right)}}=\\frac{0.05}{\\sqrt{0.88(0.12)(0.0016667+0.0025)}}=\\frac{0.05}{\\sqrt{0.00044}}=\\frac{0.05}{0.020976}=2.384\\approx2.38.$$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tỷ lệ mẫu: $\\hat p_1=\\dfrac{540}{600}=0{,}90$, $\\hat p_2=\\dfrac{340}{400}=0{,}85$. Dưới $H_0:p_1=p_2$ ta gộp: $\\hat p=\\dfrac{880}{1000}=0{,}88$. Khi đó $$z_0=\\frac{\\hat p_1-\\hat p_2}{\\sqrt{\\hat p(1-\\hat p)\\left(\\frac{1}{600}+\\frac{1}{400}\\right)}}=\\frac{0{,}05}{\\sqrt{0{,}00044}}=\\frac{0{,}05}{0{,}020976}=2{,}384\\approx2{,}38.$$</p></div>"
