          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Only the $X$ column is needed. $\\sum x=5+6+7+4+9=31$, $\\bar x=31/5=6.2$, and $\\sum x^2=25+36+49+16+81=207$, so $$S_{xx}=\\sum x^2-\\frac{(\\sum x)^2}{n}=207-\\frac{961}{5}=207-192.2=14.8.$$ Then $$se(\\hat\\beta_1)=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\sigma^2}{S_{xx}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{1.56^2}{14.8}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2.4336}{14.8}}=\\sqrt{0.16443}=0.4055\\approx0.405.$$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Chỉ cần cột $X$. $\\sum x=31$, $\\bar x=6{,}2$, $\\sum x^2=25+36+49+16+81=207$, nên $$S_{xx}=\\sum x^2-\\frac{(\\sum x)^2}{n}=207-\\frac{961}{5}=14{,}8.$$ Do đó $$se(\\hat\\beta_1)=\\sqrt{\\frac{1{,}56^2}{14{,}8}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{2{,}4336}{14{,}8}}=\\sqrt{0{,}16443}=0{,}4055\\approx0{,}405.$$</p></div>"
