          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>With $n=8$: $$S_{xy}=\\sum xy-\\frac{(\\sum x)(\\sum y)}{n}=21087-\\frac{492\\times379}{8}=21087-23308.5=-2221.5,$$ $$S_{xx}=32894-\\frac{492^2}{8}=32894-30258=2636,\\qquad S_{yy}=20115-\\frac{379^2}{8}=20115-17955.125=2159.875.$$ Then $$r=\\frac{S_{xy}}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}S_{yy}}}=\\frac{-2221.5}{\\sqrt{2636\\times2159.875}}=\\frac{-2221.5}{2386.09}=-0.931\\approx-0.93.$$ The sign is NEGATIVE (higher arithmetic skill goes with lower math anxiety), so $+0.93$ is the trap answer.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Với $n=8$: $$S_{xy}=21087-\\frac{492\\times379}{8}=21087-23308{,}5=-2221{,}5,$$ $$S_{xx}=32894-\\frac{492^2}{8}=2636,\\qquad S_{yy}=20115-\\frac{379^2}{8}=2159{,}875.$$ Do đó $$r=\\frac{S_{xy}}{\\sqrt{S_{xx}S_{yy}}}=\\frac{-2221{,}5}{2386{,}09}=-0{,}931\\approx-0{,}93.$$ Dấu ÂM (kỹ năng số học càng cao thì lo âu toán càng thấp), nên $+0{,}93$ là phương án bẫy.</p></div>"
